<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-simulans-turing-wavelength-s0-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Drosophila simulans 1.92 µm Turing carrier on the posterior-lobe arc (pass 1) — MorphoEval overall 80.5/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1 implements Schnakenberg kinetics with γ fixed so λ_c = 1.92 µm, measures a 67.57 µm annulus on the species plate (111 px = 100 µm), and fits one radial harmonic (Pearson r = 0.9825). Sweeps and the ablation exist in the script but the headline goodness-of-fit is still the in-sample single harmonic. Overall is withheld below the pass-2 bar. Overall 80.5/100 (faithfulness 77.9, reproducibility 86.8); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc; environment: . Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 80, Morphological realism / specimen match 76, Parameter expressivity 84, Morphometric validation 74, Source and data traceability 90, Code-to-model traceability 84, Reproducibility package 86. Output judged: docs/media/drosophila_simulans_turing_wavelength_s0_comparison.png: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-simulans-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 0c76d15d14afcec6c366e1b9274a6586a0de48fc, image/png, 519627 B, 1260×840 px, artifact_sha256 816d722ff5c9d5c2cc697711552b6ec75bf10c31b838f7f9d4967e8daa325a78 (sha256 816d722ff5c9d5c2cc697711552b6ec75bf10c31b838f7f9d4967e8daa325a78), spec_fingerprint 60c689b8831f2a33a5b5821273a9d442392ad8ba957aa7d326024097a96f04cd. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 60c689b8831f2a33a5b5821273a9d442392ad8ba957aa7d326024097a96f04cd; artifact_sha256: 816d722ff5c9d5c2cc697711552b6ec75bf10c31b838f7f9d4967e8daa325a78; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/drosophila_simulans_turing_wavelength_s0/Drosophila_simulans_female_wikimedia.jpg=8cf84002b7360579..., datasets/drosophila_simulans_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_simulans_turing_wavelength_s0_reference.json=cbf21999cb034540..., datasets/drosophila_simulans_turing_wavelength_s0/drosophila_simulans_turing_wavelength_s0_specimen.jpg=d581f0b19b1f33bb..., datasets/drosophila_simulans_turing_wavelength_s0/paper_citations.bib=f6fa93b93eea80e6..., datasets/drosophila_simulans_turing_wavelength_s0/scout_manifest.json=b0435b2ab49a47d2...}. Claim boundary: reported_in_source: Turing 1952 selects a finite critical wavenumber from a reaction-diffusion instability. | Glassford 2015: the epandrial posterior lobe is a melanogaster-subgroup novelty. | Hagen 2020: simulans-clade lobes diverged within about the last 240,000 years. | Edwards 2007 documents Hawaiian picture-wing melanin; Huey 2000 documents the subobscura size cline.; reconstructed_in_script: λ_c = 1.92 µm is the slot assignment, not a published granule diameter. | Neighbour wavelengths 2.64 µm and 1.60 µm are γ retunings at ratio 11/8 and 5/6. | The rendered annulus is the measured plate mode, not a relabeling of the 100 µm bar as 1.92 µm.; transfer_boundary: Silvestris and subobscura are catalog chronoseries neighbours, not phylogenetic ancestors of simulans.; does_not_claim: Does not claim a measured 1.92 µm spacing on a simulans clasper micrograph. | Does not claim the species-gallery plate is a transmission electron micrograph. | Does not claim the whole-fly Wikimedia photograph resolves the detail wavelength.." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: {'id': 'R1', 'item': 'Make the odd-radius holdout the headline goodness-of-fit, not only the in-sample single harmonic (pass-1 r = 0.9825).'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R2', 'item': 'Report computer-vision similarity of the GIF against the annular plate and, separately, against the Wikimedia whole-fly photograph.'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R3', 'item': 'Interpret the numerical-versus-analytical wavenumber gap (3.115 vs 3.272) as the bounded-disk shift instead of leaving it uninterpreted.'}",
        "remediation needed: {'id': 'R4', 'item': 'Independent second assessor is not available in this cloud session.'}" ;
    pk:hasScore 8.05e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

